#81001
"Path Through the Park"
"A small, crystal-clear pond nestled in the southeastern corner of the area
draws the eye in this part of the park.  Tall reeds grow along its banks,
perfect for water birds to nest in.  The water is warm and inviting, shallow
enough that one can see easily to its sandy bottom.  Tiny fish dart rapidly
among the plants, silver streaks racing through their watery world.  A carved
wooden bench reclines under a nearby oak tree, offering a shady spot to sit
and relax near the quiet pond.
"
"[Minqa] Benches, duck mob, kid splashing in the water.
[Minqa] Search reeds to find duck's nest, possibly get egg?
"
