"Guardroom"
"Gleaming racks of weaponry line the the northern wall of this small chamber. 
Pikes and halberds, rapiers and long swords, bladed maces and morningstars,
all find a resting place within this room.  Two long benches line the eastern
and western walls of the room, their construction simple, but sturdy.  The
walls are panelled in richly hued amber wood, giving this place a look of
elegance.
