"Within a Messy Hovel"
"The stench hovering in this place assaults the senses of any brave -- or
foolish -- enough to come within this horribly messy room.  Piles of torn
clothing and greasy rags lie moldering all over the floor, nearly hiding the
packed earth from view.  A single table stands forlornly in the center of the
room, wobbling brokenly on its three remaining legs.  Only the shattered
remains of a chair lie huddled in one corner of the small, dank room, looking
as though it has been used for tinder on occaision.
"
