#81025
"Cliff's Edge"
"The cobblestone road ends here in a small courtyard, too small to be called a
park, overlooking the impressive drop down to the ocean.  The bittersweet tang
of sea salt hovers in the air, while the echoing calls of gulls scream from
overhead.  Along the cliff's edge to the north stands a waist-high wooden
fence, providing a sturdy boundary.  A steep trail winds its way westward up a
towering pinnacle of stone.  Hanging neatly beside the path is a small sign,
its careful lettering unfaded by time or exposure to the elements.
"
"[Minqa] Exit/acode up to the Gryphon's Aerie cafe
"
