#81071
"High Within the Branches"
"Enfolded by leafy branches, this small nook is virtually undetectable from
below, though gaps in the tree's foilage allow someone perched on this sturdy
branch a bird's eye view of the park below.  Towards the end of the largest
branch jutting out from the rough trunk of the massive oak is a good-sized
nest, compiled of a hodge-podge mixture of twigs, straw and string.  The small
park spreads out below this lofty vantage point, fresh and verdant.  A bit to
the south, a gently sloping staircase leads upwards, its finely polished
marble glimmering softly in the ambiant light.
"
"[Minqa] Hide down exit, acode only
[Minqa] Acode bird's nest or some such, possible chance to fall out of tree on trying to search it.
"
